    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> 7.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðonne þæt gedon sy, ðonne rære man cyninges munde; of ðam dæge on XXI nihton gylde man healsfang; ðæs on XXI nihton manbote; ðæs on XXI nihton ðæs weres ðæt frumgyld.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">When this is done, the king's 'mund' shall be established. In twenty-one days from that time healsfang shall be paid; in twenty-one days after that, 'manbot' (the compensation due to the slain man's lord), and twenty-one days after that the first installment of the wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðonne þæt gedon sy, ðonne rære man cyninges munde; of ðam dæge on XXI nihton gylde man healsfang; ðæs on XXI nihton manbote; ðæs on XXI niht ðæs weres ðæt frumgyld.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
